      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can confirm muscle settings are not respected in-game, at least with Index controllers.\n\nClaws and even fingertips will glitch through the hand on some of my bases in-game, while in Unity's Muscle-Settings I can fully close the hands, and it won't glitch.",
